/-- **`A₄` and `S₄` are not isomorphic** (LMFDB `group.supersolvable`): they have `4` and `10`
solutions of `g ^ 2 = 1`. -/
lemma isEmpty_mulEquiv_perm_fin_four : IsEmpty (alternatingGroup (Fin 4) ≃* Perm (Fin 4)) :=
